      en: 'Total area is constant. Unprotected native forest is protected or cleared according to policies (frontier); part of the farmland returns each year to a pool reallocated by each use\'s rent, anchored to the start; land lost to a drought or a situation becomes fallow, which re-enters or regenerates.',
